@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
rectangle "T1: rear-end impact despite enabled AEB\nOR (qualitative, no probabilities)" as Top
rectangle "Insufficient threat information\nOR" as A
rectangle "Insufficient delivered deceleration\nOR" as B
rectangle "Premature release then renewed closing" as C
rectangle "Freeze / missed target / ODD exit" as A1
rectangle "Command loss / actuator failure /\nadhesion / late demand" as B1
Top --> A
Top --> B
Top --> C
A --> A1
B --> B1
note bottom of Top
Common causes and driver behavior invalidate independence assumptions.
This model has no quantitative fault probabilities.
end note
@enduml
